Package: lrmaprs
Title: Rust Backend for lrmap
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ruben", "Dries", , "rdries@bu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compiled kernels for the lrmap package: the per-shift loops of the toroidal-shift null
    (contact neighbours through a spatial hash with per-test sums, grid gather-and-sum) and a separable
    Gaussian blur, optionally multi-threaded.
